{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842320/extras/fda3e5a3f7d39fa892bacd3ee1b61cb5.poster.avif?t=1758277560\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842320/extras/fda3e5a3f7d39fa892bacd3ee1b61cb5.webm?t=1758277560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842320/extras/fda3e5a3f7d39fa892bacd3ee1b61cb5.mp4?t=1758277560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Brief story</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They thought the era of ash and dust had ended. Yet shadows have stirred again, and prophecy unfolds. Born under the moonlight, the white-haired girl Elia alone can stand against the fallen star. Awakened atop the tower, she takes up the flame to stop the nightmare overtaking the world. Now, darkness threatens once more. You hold the blade of destiny.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overview</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slayer is a strategic action game built around a finely tuned combat system and dark narrative. Survival demands more than quick reflexes\u2014you must consider movement direction, positioning, attack angles, parrying, dodging timing, and map structure.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842320/extras/6f5bfec6016dd746267046976032d8f3.avif?t=1758277560\" width=1232 height=706 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Three Modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Action Mode</strong>: Full directional attacks and combo-driven, exhilarating gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Master Mode</strong>: Front-facing attacks only. Precise positioning and strategy are essential.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Hardcore Mode</strong>: Limited lives, permadeath upon depletion. For extreme survivalists.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combat &amp; Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Strategic Souls-like combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Puzzle-like stage design</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Bosses with unique patterns and mechanics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Short, intense combat experiences</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842320/extras/1d85e7c131ccc1ef1a29352acf2628a9.poster.avif?t=1758277560\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842320/extras/1d85e7c131ccc1ef1a29352acf2628a9.webm?t=1758277560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842320/extras/1d85e7c131ccc1ef1a29352acf2628a9.mp4?t=1758277560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Coming Soon: Fallen Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arriving October 2024\u2014an expansion-like mode with new maps, enemies, bosses, and a darker, highly strategic atmosphere. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1842320/extras/bb5c957b4618ea9b34a150ee578be6a0.avif?t=1758277560\" width=800 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discord\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Beginner's Footstep","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1842320/bd7389b15eb84d9606b084784ea0aac5364041e